{"id": "sched-dev-medium-03", "mode": "/polish", "language": "en", "context": {"level": "high", "profile": "notes"}, "length": "medium", "brief": "During our team architecture retrospective, we discussed the main considerations for our upcoming platform overhaul across all regional engineering organizations.

