{"id": "sched-ws-medium-01", "mode": "/slack", "language": "en", "context": {"files": ["services/payment/webhook.ts", "workers/notification/handler.py", "config/stripe.json"], "level": "medium"}, "length": "medium", "brief": "Hey team, we need to harden our payment processing services against duplicate webhook delivery retries from payment providers. Please tag webhook dot ts in the payment service directory and review handler dot py in our async worker service before deploying to staging.

