{"id": "sched-list-medium-01", "mode": "/polish", "language": "en", "context": {"level": "high", "profile": "notes"}, "length": "medium", "brief": "Here is our standard operational checklist for Kafka cluster partition reassignment across broker instances during our scheduled weekend maintenance window.

