{"id": "sched-list-medium-03", "mode": "/polish", "language": "en", "context": {"level": "high", "profile": "technical note"}, "length": "medium", "brief": "When evaluating distributed consensus algorithms for our global replication layer, engineering teams typically examine three fundamental dimensions.

